rmconscious is communicating with the dreamer alone and is selecting
its purpose that have meaning to the dreamer and to
nobody else. Thus the interpretation of dreams, whether by the analyst
or by the dreamer himself, is for the Jungian psychologist an entirely
peisonal and individual business (and sometimes an experimental and
very lengthy one as well) that can by no means be undertaken by

symbols for

rule of thiunb.

